@startuml
title Green Rides State Transition Diagram

[*] --> InitialState : User starts

state "Initial" as InitialState
state "Logged In" as LoggedInState
state "View Journey Details" as ViewJourneyDetails
state "Driving Mode" as DrivingMode
state "Other Options (e.g., Eat)" as OtherOptions
state "Select Place to Eat" as SelectPlaceToEat
state "Place Order" as PlaceOrder
state "Accident Handling" as AccidentHandling
state "Send Notification" as SendNotification
state "Provide Feedback" as ProvideFeedback

InitialState --> LoggedInState : Login

LoggedInState --> ViewJourneyDetails : Select destination

ViewJourneyDetails --> DrivingMode : Activate driving mode
ViewJourneyDetails --> OtherOptions : Choose other options

OtherOptions --> SelectPlaceToEat : Select place to eat
SelectPlaceToEat --> PlaceOrder : Order placed
PlaceOrder --> ViewJourneyDetails : Continue journey

DrivingMode --> AccidentHandling : Accident occurs
AccidentHandling --> SendNotification : Notify authorities and user
SendNotification --> DrivingMode : Resume driving (if possible)

ViewJourneyDetails --> ProvideFeedback : Journey completed
ProvideFeedback --> [*] : Logout
@enduml
